21:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-Stipend is not an extra housing allowance",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Stipend is not an extra housing allowance"}],[["$","p","EPFL’s description states CHF 3,600 for two months, with housing paid from that amount beforehand and approximately CHF 1,700 remaining for living costs. Published travel reimbursement limits are CHF 1,000 for overseas flights and CHF 500 for shorter journeys. Keep the funding total separate from the amount available after housing.",{"children":"EPFL’s description states CHF 3,600 for two months, with housing paid from that amount beforehand and approximately CHF 1,700 remaining for living costs. Published travel reimbursement limits are CHF 1,000 for overseas flights and CHF 500 for shorter journeys. Keep the funding total separate from the amount available after housing."}],["$","p","For a personal cash-flow plan, distinguish what you may need to pay before departure from what is reimbursed later. Keep a small contingency for your own discretionary spending. Do not add the value of programme-arranged housing to the full stipend as if both were separate cash payments.",{"children":"For a personal cash-flow plan, distinguish what you may need to pay before departure from what is reimbursed later. Keep a small contingency for your own discretionary spending. Do not add the value of programme-arranged housing to the full stipend as if both were separate cash payments."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://www.epfl.ch/schools/sv/education/summer-research-program/program-description/",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.epfl.ch/schools/sv/education/summer-research-program/program-description/","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"EPFL programme description and funding"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","2-Prepare outside the form, then submit in one sitting",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Prepare outside the form, then submit in one sitting"}],[["$","p","The application page says the form cannot be saved and resumed. Prepare the materials first. EPFL’s FAQ describes short personal and lab-choice answers rather than a formal CV/motivation-letter upload, and says a referee receives the upload invitation after you submit. This changes the preparation order: checking referee availability must happen before the final submission, not after it.",{"children":"The application page says the form cannot be saved and resumed. Prepare the materials first. EPFL’s FAQ describes short personal and lab-choice answers rather than a formal CV/motivation-letter upload, and says a referee receives the upload invitation after you submit. This changes the preparation order: checking referee availability must happen before the final submission, not after it."}],["$","p","Copy the current prompts into a private working document and note each character limit. Draft with space to spare, then check the actual field counter in the official portal. A word count and a character count are different. Do not rely on a generic scholarship letter where the form asks for several separate answers.",{"children":"Copy the current prompts into a private working document and note each character limit. Draft with space to spare, then check the actual field counter in the official portal. A word count and a character count are different. Do not rely on a generic scholarship letter where the form asks for several separate answers."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$L24","$undefined"]}],"$L25","$L26"]}]
